OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fthis evening, but cloud thickening
OL,7,Ffrom the west overnight, bringing
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavier and
OL,9,Fshowery into the early hours. Though
OL,10,Ftemperatures will be higher than
OL,11,Fprevious nights, a touch of rural
OL,12,Ffrost is still likely.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FSome bright spells on Sunday,
OL,15,Fbut also rain and showers which may be
OL,16,Fheavy with the odd rumble of thunder.
OL,17,FFeeling chilly and unpleasant in the
OL,18,Fwet and breezy conditions.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
