OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,6,Fearly brightness on Monday morning,
OL,7,Fthough wet and windy weather moving
OL,8,Fnortheast through the day. Brighter
OL,9,Fbut with blustery showers on Tuesday,
OL,10,Fand remaining very showery on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
